{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PianoGlow is a multi-purpose Piano application:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer - play and listen to others around the globe! Queue-based multiplayer mode to take turns playing piano! Global chatroom!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with both MIDI piano and QWERTY keyboard - that's right, play with your laptop/computer keyboard!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ear training &amp; note reading game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning visuals &amp; particle effects that move in sync with the tempo of your playing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record &amp; load MIDI files (live play or render as video from within the app).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize by uploading a video file as a background.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Circle-of-Fifths cheat sheet - clicking shows the common chord triads, key signature and the 7th chords.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-play QWERTY sheet music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize colors and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discord community to share QWERTY sheet music and your covers. Piano Glow has a community of over 700 Discord members.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable reverb &amp; equalizer audio effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chord Name Identifier &amp; Intervals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Velocity integration with a few Analog QWERTY keyboards so that you can play with dynamics on the computer keyboard (loud &amp; soft).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show sheet staff notation for treble &amp; bass clefs while playing piano, to train note-reading ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload custom Soundfont (.sf2) files!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game currency with daily rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop to share and download QWERTY sheet music or MIDI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"MIDI Pedal 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499520/b9824460ca7a226fc8b6dd132d1a2e629cec03c9.jpg"},{"name":"MIDI Pedal 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499520/e944ce9d277ed354c6d499d541be7caea7150873.jpg"},{"name":"QWERTY Pedal 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499520/58df3d1f3dff46883f0ba06cc89db5df3ae327c3.jpg"},{"name":"QWERTY Pedal 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499520/2988b03f5687a3bf3bff58ef8dbfdf4dafbec745.jpg"},{"name":"QWERTY Notes 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499520/f11b00c7863410aad90353295db1658403d80262.jpg"},{"name":"QWERTY Notes 1K","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499520/07b4b5d79496262c4c8883cbd0989d6c00d56c21.jpg"},{"name":"QWERTY Notes 10K","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499520/4bc6bce4a8a23338b0e18530c9a1285e183fef33.jpg"},{"name":"MIDI Notes 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499520/0c79cda7504c0a88214f9352da0b2d6b50ee7777.jpg"},{"name":"MIDI Notes 1K","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499520/f63052bf0d77331b35a9a8e9bbe9d5ebe7372675.jpg"},{"name":"MIDI Notes 10K","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499520/f1a56b5a6859df1e817bb4f262c4baca05ebf8bd.jpg"}],"total":105},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499520?t=1763161875","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499520?t=1763161875","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com